  "description": "Operating Area: Thailand\n\nStep on board, and you will instantly fall in love with every inch of this yacht. From the lavish exteriors designed by Leopard Yachts to the lush interiors that spell out modern and luxury yet give you comfort and feel at home. After a long day of island hopping, water activities, and exploration, you can relax and enjoy the comfortable atmosphere on board. This Sports Cruiser comes with speed, style and spacious areas from outdoors sunbeds to an indoor lounge, providing comfortable spaces for dining and relaxing while cruising. Three cabins consist of 1 Master with a King bed, 1 VIP Guest cabin with a Queen bed and 1 guest cabin with twin beds that can accommodate 6 guests overnight.",
